  {
   "kind": "line",
   "n": 12,
   "speaker": "ustaad",
   "role": "bhaavarth",
   "section": "3. AAYAT-DAR-AAYAT",
   "ayah": 2,
   "text": "पहला जुमला: अल्लाह — उसके सिवा इबादत के लायक़ कोई नहीं।",
   "tags": [],
   "audio": "audio/tts/012_ustaad.wav",
   "seconds": 5.76,
   "tts_ok": true,
   "start": 56.937,
   "end": 62.27
  },
  {
   "kind": "line",
   "n": 81,
   "speaker": "ustaad",
   "role": "matlab",
   "section": "3. AAYAT-DAR-AAYAT",
   "ayah": 2,
   "text": "'अल्लाह' उस ज़ात का नाम है जो सारी मख़लूक़ का अकेला रब है। इसीलिए इबादत सिर्फ़ उसी की।",
   "tags": [
    "U1"
   ],
   "audio": "audio/tts/081_ustaad.wav",
   "seconds": 9.28,
   "tts_ok": true,
   "start": 63.42,
   "end": 72.013
  },
  {
   "kind": "line",
   "n": 72,
   "speaker": "ustaad",
   "role": "ucharan",
   "section": "3. AAYAT-DAR-AAYAT",
   "ayah": 3,
   "text": "अल हय्युल क़य्यूम",
   "tags": [],
   "audio": "audio/tts/072_ustaad.wav",
   "seconds": 2.8,
   "tts_ok": true,
   "start": 74.963,
   "end": 77.556
  },
  {
   "kind": "line",
   "n": 16,
   "speaker": "ustaad",
   "role": "bhaavarth",
   "section": "3. AAYAT-DAR-AAYAT",
   "ayah": 3,
   "text": "दूसरा जुमला: वो हमेशा ज़िंदा है, और सबको थामे-सँभाले हुए है।",
   "tags": [],
   "audio": "audio/tts/016_ustaad.wav",
   "seconds": 6.68,
   "tts_ok": true,
   "start": 77.906,
   "end": 84.091
