   "kind": "line",
   "n": 19,
   "speaker": "ustaad",
   "role": "matlab",
   "section": "3. AAYAT-DAR-AAYAT",
   "ayah": 3,
   "text": "'क़य्यूम' यानी जो ख़ुद अपने दम पर क़ायम है और सबको क़ायम रखता है — सब उसके सहारे, वो किसी के सहारे नहीं।",
   "tags": [
    "U2"
   ],
   "audio": "audio/tts/019_ustaad.wav",
   "seconds": 10.12,
   "tts_ok": true,
   "start": 90.998,
   "end": 100.369
  },
  {
   "kind": "line",
   "n": 73,
   "speaker": "ustaad",
   "role": "ucharan",
   "section": "3. AAYAT-DAR-AAYAT",
   "ayah": 4,
   "text": "ला ताख़ुज़ुहू सिनतुन वला नौम",
   "tags": [],
   "audio": "audio/tts/073_ustaad.wav",
   "seconds": 4.84,
   "tts_ok": true,
   "start": 103.319,
   "end": 107.8
  },
  {
   "kind": "line",
   "n": 21,
   "speaker": "ustaad",
   "role": "bhaavarth",
   "section": "3. AAYAT-DAR-AAYAT",
   "ayah": 4,
   "text": "तीसरा जुमला: न उसे ऊँघ आती है, न नींद।",
   "tags": [],
   "audio": "audio/tts/021_ustaad.wav",
   "seconds": 5.4,
   "tts_ok": true,
   "start": 108.15,
   "end": 113.15
  },
  {
   "kind": "line",
   "n": 23,
   "speaker": "sawaal",
   "role": "misaal",
   "section": "3. AAYAT-DAR-AAYAT",
   "ayah": 4,
   "text": "हम तो थोड़ी देर जागें तो आँखें भारी हो जाती हैं, और ऊँघ आने लगती है।",
   "tags": [
    "MISAAL"
   ],
   "audio": "audio/tts/023_sawaal.wav",
   "seconds": 4.76,
   "tts_ok": true,
   "start": 114.55,
   "end": 118.957
  },
