   "n": 74,
   "speaker": "ustaad",
   "role": "ucharan",
   "section": "3. AAYAT-DAR-AAYAT",
   "ayah": 5,
   "text": "लहू मा फ़ी अस्समावाति वमा फ़िल अर्ज़",
   "tags": [],
   "audio": "audio/tts/074_ustaad.wav",
   "seconds": 4.68,
   "tts_ok": true,
   "start": 131.878,
   "end": 136.211
  },
  {
   "kind": "line",
   "n": 26,
   "speaker": "ustaad",
   "role": "bhaavarth",
   "section": "3. AAYAT-DAR-AAYAT",
   "ayah": 5,
   "text": "चौथा जुमला: आसमानों में जो कुछ है और ज़मीन में जो कुछ है — सब उसी का है।",
   "tags": [],
   "audio": "audio/tts/026_ustaad.wav",
   "seconds": 8.08,
   "tts_ok": true,
   "start": 136.561,
   "end": 144.043
